From 021d1da97afbe19a5f490b6cd9bd745318d7fee9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:54:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(account): a sync refused because the account was signed
 out in another tab is reported in the learner's language
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

dbcb396 made saveProgress refuse a write once the session is gone, so a 立即同步 whose
cloud read was still in flight when another tab signed out stops before sending anything.
Its error was the guard's own English — "not signed in as this account" — printed on the
sign-in form in every interface language, while every other sync outcome speaks the
learner's language. humanError now maps it to three-language copy that also says the
progress is still on this device and a new sign-in will sync it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/Account.tsx | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/Account.tsx b/src/Account.tsx
index 20f767e..25e8d40 100644
--- a/src/Account.tsx
+++ b/src/Account.tsx
@@ -45,6 +45,12 @@ function humanError(e: unknown, l: Lang): string {
     return T("同步没有响应，请稍后再试。",
              "Sinkronisasi tidak merespons. Coba lagi nanti.",
              "The sync did not respond. Try again later.", l);
+  // saveProgress refuses a write once the session is gone (another tab signed out while this
+  // one was syncing): the wording was the guard's own English, printed on the sign-in form
+  if (m.includes("not signed in as this account"))
+    return T("这次没有同步：账号已在别处退出登录。记录仍在这台设备上，重新登录后再同步。",
+             "Tidak jadi disinkronkan: akun sudah keluar di tempat lain. Datamu masih di perangkat ini — masuk lagi untuk menyinkronkan.",
+             "Not synced: the account was signed out elsewhere. Your progress is still on this device — sign in again to sync.", l);
   if (m.includes("cloud read failed"))
     return T("暂时读不到云端记录，没有改动任何数据，请稍后再试。",
              "Data cloud belum bisa dibaca. Tidak ada yang diubah — coba lagi nanti.",
